id=MTK_D8100_Vulkan1.4.Panvk
name=Dimensity 8100 PanVK WSI7 (Vulkan only)
version=0.3.0-wsi7
versionCode=6
author=wxcvm; upstream zenithblue-oss
description=WSI7 PanVK (Mesa 26.3 + 019-030 patches) for PGKM10/Android 17. Default OFF (OEM Vulkan). When enabled, the ICD is bound into the app spawn namespaces only; SurfaceFlinger, system_server and other system processes keep the OEM driver. Toggle from the module Action button and reboot.
